      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-14/paraguay-bank-scandal-corruption-charges-shakes-safe-haven-status</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">8cd4350f50657d9423f764b6</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 14:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Paraguay won over investors in recent years thanks to strong growth, low taxes and a reputation as a safe haven in a volatile region. But the president’s downfall, a central bank in disarray and a financial firm in ruins have left investors questioning whether the country is still a good bet.</description>
